{"availability":"available","full":"cefege/seo-chat-bot","name":"seo-chat-bot","description":"RAG-powered chatbot for Semantic SEO Q&A — GPT-3.5 + Pinecone + Streamlit","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"Python","stars":79,"forks":31,"created":"2023-04-27T23:31:38Z","updated":"2026-04-13T06:18:24Z","branch":"master","homepage":"","topics":["chatbot","llm","openai","pinecone","python","rag","semantic-seo","streamlit"],"demo":"https://seo-chat-bot.streamlit.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:08.493Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:08.493Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:08.493Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:47:08.493Z","stars":79,"forks":31}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A production-grade RAG chatbot that answers SEO questions using retrieval-augmented generation — grounding every answer in expert source material with inline citations.","Most LLM chatbots hallucinate freely. In a domain like SEO — where outdated or wrong advice can tank a site's rankings — that's unacceptable.","This project solves that by building a Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) pipeline that:"],"features":["Retrieves relevant content from a curated knowledge base of expert SEO articles before generating an answer","Forces the model to cite its sources with clickable links, so users can verify every claim","Filters results by relevance score, so low-quality matches never pollute the context","Maintains conversation memory across turns, so follow-up questions work naturally","Every answer is grounded in retrieved source material — not the model's training data. This dramatically reduces hallucination and ensures answers reflect the actual expert content in the knowledge base."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/cefege/seo-chat-bot/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"6b694435006ee44f21573bffe61e1f9c6cdbe8d8883e11d5f5b1fee982c8d251","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:47:08.734Z"},"overview